Subject: [PATCH] soc: zte: accept the verified SR7420 boot information ABI

The SR7420 2B4 live DT contains the same 1400-byte versioninfo ABI as
SR1010. Its selected record and embedded version-header CRC were checked
against the stock package. Slot offsets remain board-specific.

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/zte.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/zte.yaml
@@ -19,7 +19,9 @@
   compatible:
     oneOf:
       - items:
-          - const: zte,zx279133-sr1010
+          - enum:
+              - zte,zx279133-sr1010
+              - zte,zx279133-sr7420
           - const: zte,zx279133
       - items:
           - enum:
--- a/drivers/soc/zte/zx279133-bootinfo.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/zte/zx279133-bootinfo.c
@@ -89,7 +89,8 @@
 	const void *data;
 	int len;
 
-	if (!of_machine_is_compatible("zte,zx279133-sr1010"))
+	if (!of_machine_is_compatible("zte,zx279133-sr1010") &&
+	    !of_machine_is_compatible("zte,zx279133-sr7420"))
 		return -ENODEV;
 
 	data = of_get_property(of_chosen, "versioninfo", &len);
